d loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773720/extras/b4d248ec599a0cfdc789026c40902542.poster.avif?t=1749529593\" width=476 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773720/extras/b4d248ec599a0cfdc789026c40902542.webm?t=1749529593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773720/extras/b4d248ec599a0cfdc789026c40902542.mp4?t=1749529593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your generator for exponential growth!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773720/extras/9b46953dbd695bd6b66d2e9fa5502c87.poster.avif?t=1749529593\" width=476 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773720/extras/9b46953dbd695bd6b66d2e9fa5502c87.webm?t=1749529593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773720/extras/9b46953dbd695bd6b66d2e9fa5502c87.mp4?t=1749529593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incremental progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Tokens for content generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touching rags-to-riches narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and sweet experience(~2.5 hours of playtime)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
